\item[* author:] Lisette Appelo
\item[* copied from:] TTempconjsentadaptation English
\item[* modification:]\mbox{}
\begin{enumerate}
\item date: ../../..\ \ \ \ \ author:
\item date: ../../..\ \ \ \ \ author:
\end{enumerate}
\item[* task:] To adapt temporal adverbial sentences for the right conjdeixis.
In case an omegadeixis reference conjunction the tense is an indication for deictic 
function of the temporal adverbial sentence. This has not been incorporated in 
the surface parser.
